{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t一輛龍運巴士下午在機場航天城總站內懷疑失控，撞毀站內欄杆，無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方下午2時許接報，指一輛巴士在航天城總站內撞毀約10米長的欄杆。網上圖片可見，涉事巴士車頭損毀，零件散落路面，站內欄杆被撞至變形。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：陳曉慶\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:18:50.718476+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:10:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:57:47.834982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:17:34.266143+00:00","content_hash":"841878ec67a1cc6d9a6747427c3ad4de418465cb5918aa62911c22ce39b6a556","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}